{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a1974f149f292cb711d4198587aa0af6e549eda9a2cc7944e5f32d2daa4d4088", "ja": "（無人島でのサバイバル生活に挑戦した恵美たち。\n過酷な企画だったが、最後まで撮影し終えた……）", "zh": "（挑战了无人岛生存生活的惠美她们。虽然企划十分艰苦，但总算坚持拍摄到了最后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "61bcc186029a983aa357360a0bc6e35489769e826af58362b98638747675fb1d", "ja": "お疲れ～、{$P$}。\nは～、やり切った！　もうクタクタだよ～！", "zh": "辛苦啦，{$P$}。\n哈——总算完成了！已经累得筋疲力尽啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1002_p", "source_sha256": "09027ddd608ca255c63f343fff26e60d3d0f73b3673ddc3c1330db8fae139356", "ja": "恵美、本当にお疲れ様。\n大変な仕事を振っちゃって、ごめんな。", "zh": "惠美，真的辛苦你了。\n派了这么辛苦的工作给你，抱歉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "368cf27e1473a60c689ad38bbb4af516ea51c92d6c46d99c7959f65fdee16faf", "ja": "謝らなくていいってば～！　確かに、すっごーく\n疲れてるけど、メッチャ楽しくて疲れたってカンジ♪", "zh": "都说了不用道歉啦～！确实是累得不得了，\n但这种累是因为特别开心才累的感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6a4f76563dc336fdb7dcd8d7edb93c99ada65ac648528f8164b7c7af6de2f61b", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。正直、恵美が\nこんなに頑張ってくれるとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。我还真没想到惠美会这么努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e478d53e152c5c84955fb4fbc48cd5fd985d0a32756ed3fd56ccf1a9aa6f0e8", "ja": "そう？　アタシは、\nいつもどおり、やってたつもりだけど……。", "zh": "是吗？我只是觉得自己一直都和平时一样在努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d7fd98cfec0adbe6ff173e4c3bc9adfa37a0bdc5c663d87c38c05cccf17a2caf", "ja": "うん。恵美のその『いつも通り』が、すごくよかった。\n普段とは違う環境でも、楽しそうにしてて……。", "zh": "嗯。惠美那种“和平时一样”的状态，真的特别好。\n即使身处和平时不同的环境，也还是一副乐在其中的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5f27ffeb30e6da5fc8588c92f05b967785571512fb299413a7db7851e9435b5c", "ja": "まあ、服を作りはじめた時は驚いたけど……。", "zh": "不过，你开始做起衣服的时候，我还真是吃了一惊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "c603d16ca78ea8ce4c464e5aa0c27053c7add56b22b82ab47f88837610a94676", "ja": "{$P$}……、もしかして、\nギャルはサバイバルに向いてないとか思ってる？", "zh": "{$P$}……你该不会觉得，辣妹不适合生存挑战吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "5a25ee8d5d64e4ac200c387a1fb97a9a0e2af54b60a793233595c5de06e22fd2", "ja": "そりゃ、電気もない、ネットもないジャングルだよ？\nでもさ、どこに居ても楽しまなきゃ損じゃん？", "zh": "那可是个既没有电、也没有网络的丛林啊？\n不过，不管身在何处，都得享受其中才不算亏嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "d99ffcd6275761de4fdf623fa8c622118da4f8a6924b08c5c93c091b29d1185e", "ja": "お仕事とはいえ、せっかくみんなで来てるんだもん。\nオシャレなほうが、テンションも上がるよね♪", "zh": "虽然是来工作的，但难得大家一起过来嘛。打扮得时髦一点，心情也会更好吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33a74ae1a66462ab05a0b94fcdb585f04b9ec97f3e9cdd44db23a427c2c12635", "ja": "はは、そのバイタリティには本当に救われたよ。\n恵美のおかげで、いい雰囲気になったから。", "zh": "哈哈，多亏了你这股活力，真是帮大忙了。\n托惠美的福，气氛也变得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "b9bac8daf9775754f5b5d566792dcf6261fb05cb3d2aec164540bd51de6830bd", "ja": "も～、大げさだって！\nやっぱ可愛いほうがいいよねってだけなんだから。", "zh": "真是的～太夸张啦！\n我只是觉得还是可爱点比较好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "909f37a8fb93b85f8fe398ee79db42974380aa261d8e06ed4deefe5384a44730", "ja": "アタシも、ちょっと不安だったんだよ？　……でも、\n過ごしてみたら、思ったより楽しかったなって！", "zh": "我其实也有点不安的哦？……不过，\n真正过下来，感觉比想象中更开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "c6e67dbbb659efa26d68207aebd05875b7ef6a058a11503ea24409b2400f7953", "ja": "快適に過ごすために、いろいろ工夫したり……\n代わりになる物を探したり。毎日、何か考えてたしね。", "zh": "为了住得舒服点，想了各种办法……\n还找过能代替原本东西的物品。每天都在琢磨些什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1016_p", "source_sha256": "29c789a4793506a06f8d4a71b68d272eb283c9a9cf219d181621debe920be286", "ja": "そうだな。今までの生活をしていたら、\n滅多にできない経験ではあったな……。", "zh": "是啊。要是一直过以前那样的生活，确实很难有这种经历……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0703_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "31f8cf79cde3c86a0e340fe83a91255111813bd6a69408f3cf3b65494720cb17", "ja": "でしょ？　毎日はさすがにキツいけど……たまになら\nサバイバルもアリかも？　なんてね。にゃはは♪", "zh": "对吧？每天都这样确实有点够呛……不过偶尔来一次生存挑战，好像也不错？开玩笑的。呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
